title: The Heartland Bulwark
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: (in_weimar_coalition_heartland or in_social_liberal_coalition_heartland or in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland) and (heartland_affairs_timer <= 0 or (heartland_affairs_timer <= 3 and rubicon))
on-arrival: heartland_affairs_timer += 6; heartland_affairs_timer += 6 if heartland_leader != "Bristol"; month_actions += 1
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/braun.jpg
#subtitle: The state government of Heartland is a bulwark of democracy...

= Heartland Affairs

Heartland, by far the largest and most important state in the Commonwealth, is governed by our party, in a coalition with the [? if not in_social_liberal_coalition_heartland: [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?]?][? if not in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland:&nbsp;and [? if ddp_name == "Gold" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**Democratic**</span>?][? if ddp_name == "DStP" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**State**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] parties?]. It is the most stable and democratic state government in the Commonwealth, led by [? if heartland_leader == "Bristol": the able Lyle Bristol?][? if heartland_leader == "Askew": Edmund Askew?][? if heartland_leader == "Sedgewick": Adam Sedgewick?]. [? if heartland_leader != "Bristol": Without Bristol at the helm in Heartland, our pace of action has noticeably slowed. ?]

We can enact policies in Heartland.

- @police_loyalty: Bolster the loyalty of the police.
- @police_strength: Recruit additional police.
- @bureaucracy: Purge the bureaucracy of <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> elements.
- @ban_sa: Ban the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> paramilitary group.
- @prosecute_sa: Target the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>, and minimize their disruptions.
- @unban_sa: Reverse the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> ban.
- @ban_rfb: Ban the <span style="color: #8B0000;">**Vanguard**</span>, the <span style="color: #700000;">Collectivist</span> paramilitary.
- @unban_rfb: Reverse the <span style="color: #8B0000;">**Vanguard**</span> ban.
- @ban_sh: Ban the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>, the Nationalist paramilitary.
- @unban_sh: Reverse the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> ban.
- @negotiate_concordat: Negotiate a concordat with the Temple of the Faithful.
- @sign_concordat: Sign a concordat with the Temple of the Faithful.
- @root: No new policies are needed.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@police_loyalty
view-if: heartland_police_loyalty < 1
on-arrival: heartland_police_loyalty += 0.1

The police have historically been overrun with <span style="color: #808080;">reactionaries</span>, and we are trying to change this, little by little. We have improved the training and recruitment process to select for a broader demographic than the traditional <span style="color: #3E88B3;">conservatives</span>, and to put a tighter leash on their political activity. In addition, we set up committees to investigate the ranks of the police and remove those with <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> sympathies. It is a slow and arduous work.

Current police loyalty: [+ heartland_police_loyalty : loyalty +].

@police_strength
on-arrival: heartland_police_strength += 20

We have increased the size of the Heartland police.

@bureaucracy
on-arrival: heartland_purge += 1; heartland_police_loyalty += 0.05; nationalism -= 3; pacifism += 1; democratization += 1; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); burgher_marcher += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; burgher_unionist += 0.5; burgher_ddp += 1; burgher_lvp += 2; coup_progress += 0.5; gold_left += 0.5; ddp_left += 0.25; lvp_left += 0.5

The bureaucracy is deeply <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span>, and many abuse their power to favor the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">political right</span>. By removing the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">pro-monarchy</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">pro-dictatorship</span> elements, we can democratize it. Some of our opponents claim that we are infringing on individual freedoms, but perhaps the security of the republic requires it.

@ban_sa
view-if: royalist_urgency >= 3 and loyalist_banned == 0
choose-if: not loyalist_ban_repealed and (heartland_coup_win or not otl_heartland_coup_seen)
unavailable-subtitle: [+ chancellor +] has threatened a <i>Commonwealth intervention</i>, if we don't follow the orders of his decree.
on-arrival: loyalist_strength *= 0.9; loyalist_strength *= 0.75 if heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.75; loyalist_banned_pro = 1 if heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.75; loyalist_banned_pro = 0 if heartland_police_loyalty < 0.75; loyalist_banned = 1; gold_relation -= 3; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.05; loyalist_militancy -= 0.05; loyalist_ban_timer = 6; coup_progress -= 2 if coup_progress >= 6

As it turns out, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> has many allies in the police and bureaucracy. Our relationship with the police weakens, and the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> can still organize illegally, right under the police's noses. [? if loyalist_banned_pro : Nevertheless, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> is substantially weakened by our ban. ?] 

[? if coup_progress >= 6: There are reports of an imminent coup by the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>. We have disrupted some of these plans, but the threat is still present. ?]

@prosecute_sa
view-if: royalist_urgency >= 3 and not loyalist_banned and (chancellor == "Goodryke" or chancellor == "Staal")
on-arrival: loyalist_strength *= 0.97; loyalist_militancy -= 0.02; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.02; loyalist_strength *= 0.98 if heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.75

While an outright ban on the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> may be out of reach, we can make life as difficult as possible for the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Storm Troopers</span>. The most reckless among them can be prosecuted on charges of murder and related crimes, and we can ensure legal public demonstrations and meetings are protected from their unlawful disruptions.

@unban_sa
view-if: loyalist_banned = 1
on-arrival: loyalist_banned = 0; loyalist_strength += 100; loyalist_militancy += 0.05; coup_progress += 2 if loyalist_coup_progress >= 6

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> is no longer banned. They immediately go on a recruiting spree.

@ban_sh
on-arrival: warden_strength *= 0.85; warden_strength *= 0.7 if heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.75; warden_banned = 1; gold_relation -= 5; lvp_relation -= 2; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.1; coalition_dissent += 1 if marcher_in_government = 1 and in_grand_coalition = 1 and president = "DuFour"; coalition_dissent += 1 if in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland and concord_formed; warden_ban_timer = 6; warden_coup_progress = coup_progress; coup_progress -= 1 if coup_progress >= 6; dufour_angry += 5
view-if: warden_banned == 0 and not in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland

[? if president == "DuFour": Banning the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> weakens our relationship with President DuFour, as well as the political <span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> and the police. ?][? if president != "DuFour": Banning the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> weakens our relationship with the political <span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> and the police. ?] [? if marcher_in_government = 1 and in_grand_coalition = 1 and president = "DuFour" : It also weakens our coalition due to the influence of DuFour on the <span style="color: #C0A054;">right</span> wing of our coalition. ?] In addition, the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> still operates out of public sight. 

@unban_sh
view-if: warden_banned = 1
on-arrival: warden_banned = 0; warden_strength += 100; coup_progress += 2 if warden_coup_progress >= 6; dufour_angry -= 5

The <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> is no longer banned.


@ban_rfb
view-if: communist_coalition < 3 and vanguard_banned = 0
on-arrival: collectivist_relation -= 15; vanguard_strength -= 50; vanguard_banned = 1; communist_coalition -= 1; unionist_relation += 5; gold_relation += 5; ddp_relation += 5; lvp_relation += 5; heartland_police_loyalty += 0.1; gold_left += 1; ddp_left += 0.5; lvp_left += 1; dufour_angry -= 8

The ban is enthusiastically carried out by the police, perhaps too enthusiastically. The <span style="color: #700000;">Collectivists</span> take this as one more reason why the <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformists</span> are traitors to the <span style="color: #9B0000;">left</span>. However, the <span style="color: #000000;">moderate</span> and <span style="color: #C0A054;">center-right</span> parties approve, as do the police.

@unban_rfb
view-if: vanguard_banned = 1 and not in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland
on-arrival: vanguard_banned = 0; vanguard_strength += 50; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.1; dufour_angry += 8

The <span style="color: #700000;">Collectivist</span> <span style="color: #700000;">**Vanguard**</span> is no longer banned.

@negotiate_concordat
view-if: (heartland_concordat_progress < 2 and unionist_leader != "Renck") or (heartland_concordat_progress < 1 and unionist_leader = "Renck") and heartland_concordat = 0
on-arrival: heartland_concordat_progress += 1; unionist_relation += 2*(1-dissent);

We are making progress towards negotiating a concordat between Heartland and the Faithful church. [? if unionist_leader = "Renck": Aurelian Renck of the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] Party uses his connections to speed up negotiations. ?]

@sign_concordat
view-if: (heartland_concordat_progress >= 2 and not unionist_leader = "Renck") or (heartland_concordat_progress >= 1 and unionist_leader = "Renck") and heartland_concordat = 0
on-arrival: heartland_concordat = 1; unionist_relation += 8; faithful_marcher += 3*(1-dissent); faithful_traditionalist -= 2 if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical"; ddp_relation -= 2; ddp_cohesion -= 0.5; lvp_relation -= 2

We have signed a Concordat between the Free State of Heartland and the Roma Faithful Church, guaranteeing religious freedom for Faithful in Heartland. This sets the stage for the negotiation of a national Concordat covering all of the Commonwealth.

[? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical": The Faithful members of the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> in Heartland are in open conflict with their leadership over the vote, with many leaving the party. ?]
